      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Subtracting \\(1\\) from \\(11000_2\\) requires borrowing through the three trailing zeros. Thus \\[ 11000_2-1_2=10111_2. \\]\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is E.",
